{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19027","headline":"令狐相公频示新什早春南望遐想汉中因抒短章以寄情愫 · 刘禹锡","name":"令狐相公频示新什早春南望遐想汉中因抒短章以寄情愫","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"军城临汉水，旌斾起春风。\n远思见江草，归心看塞鸿。\n野花沿古道，新叶映行宫。\n惟有诗兼酒，朝朝两不同。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19027.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19027","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}